<title>USA: EDO Corp Q1 oper EPS flat.</title>
<headline>EDO Corp Q1 oper EPS flat.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.20		    $0.20</p>
<p> Oper net		   1,561		    1,480</p>
<p> Revs			23,704		   23,669</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,245		    5,923</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Year-ago Q1 1996 oper income excludes a loss of $0.09 a share or $527,000 from discontinued energy-related operations. Including the loss, net income was $0.11 a share.</p>
<p>All shr figures are primary. On a fully diluted basis, earnings per share from continuing operations were $0.17 compared with $0.17.</p>
<p>Oper net figures are before the payment of preferred dividends. Preferred dividend payments totalled $290,000 in Q1 1997 and $303,000 in Q1 1996.</p>
</text>
